From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:14:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] RW-023: the weekly summary reaches every owner with an open
 goal, not the same 200
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Live, 12 Oct 06:02Z: „weekly summaries sent to 200 user(s)" while 758 had an
open goal. The LIMIT 200 was taken before the „summarised this week" check,
in text order of the id, so the same 200 got it every Monday and 558 never
did, the tester's four seats among them. The check is now in the query, the
run takes batches until nobody is owed (at most 50), and an owner whose send
failed is not tried again in the same run. Read-only check of the new query
on live: 558 owed. No new text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
